error: `File.createText` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_async_create_blocking.sg:3:22
 3 |     var w = try File.createText(read path)
   |                      ^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await File.createTextAsync(read path)` does the same work without holding the thread
